  "details": "This bug was fixed at some point but now it has returned.\n\nWhen players load into the world and they passed the \"Initializing World\" part in the loading screen, they appear for others in the world as already loaded in and spawn at the world origin until they passed the \"Joining\" text.\n\nPlayers should either remain on world spawn or be not visible until they really loaded into the world.",
